  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Little Zen loads pages in its own window and the default container. `Ctrl+O` still moves the page into a Space afterward, and container-extension redirects stay in the little window.\n- The frame, URL bar, and controls take their colors from the painted page, including while scrolling, and those samples are kept per site. Idle windows follow Zen\u2019s chrome theme, and window controls darken on bright headers.\n- Window controls can sit on the left. The Space picker sits on the opposite side, and the compact window is sized to the URL bar.\n- The URL bar still uses Zen\u2019s trimmed display. Zia\u2019s toolbar and address-bar rules no longer override the little window.\n- External links that are direct downloads stay in the normal window. The address is checked first, then the response headers, before a Little Zen window opens.\n- The Space picker is a panel in the style of a Zen folder list: search, mouse and keyboard selection, regular menu type, and icons that follow the panel color.",
